// Compatibility shim: the vendored upstream test harness and build scripts
// were written against TON's fift library. TOS renamed TonUtil.fif to
// TosUtil.fif and Gram words to Tomi words; the semantics (1e9 base units)
// are identical. This shim keeps the vendored harness byte-identical to
// upstream, which keeps the parity diff reviewable.
"TosUtil.fif" include
{ Tomi, } : Gram,
{ Tomi@+ } : Gram@+
{ Tomi@ } : Gram@
